{
  "name": "Instagram-Studio — Fase 1 (Gatilho de Drive)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fase 1 — Ingestão & Sugestões (gatilho de Drive)\n\nQuando um arquivo novo aparece na pasta `00_inbox` do Google Drive, chama o serviço `instagram-studio`, que organiza e devolve o resumo; se houver post novo, envia por Gmail.\n\n**Antes de ativar:**\n1. A pasta `00_inbox` do Drive deve estar sincronizada no servidor (Drive para Desktop ou rclone) — o serviço lê o disco local.\n2. Selecione a credencial do Google Drive e cole o ID da pasta `00_inbox`.\n3. No nó HTTP, ajuste a URL e o `x-studio-token`.\n4. No nó Gmail, selecione a credencial e o destinatário.\n\nO gatilho dispara por arquivo; a ingestão é idempotente (inbox vazia = nada acontece), então rajadas de upload são seguras.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note1",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [120, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": { "item": [{ "mode": "everyMinute" }] },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "COLE_O_ID_DA_PASTA_00_inbox"
        },
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Drive: arquivo novo na inbox",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:4599/ingest?move=1",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "x-studio-token", "value": "COLE_SEU_STUDIO_TOKEN" }]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http",
      "name": "studio /ingest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [420, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-count",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "iff",
      "name": "Tem post novo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "voce@exemplo.com",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.suggestions }}",
        "options": { "appendAttribution": false }
      },
      "id": "gmail",
      "name": "Gmail: enviar sugestões",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [940, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "noop",
      "name": "Nada novo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [940, 540]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Drive: arquivo novo na inbox": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "studio /ingest", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "studio /ingest": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Tem post novo?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Tem post novo?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail: enviar sugestões", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Nada novo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {}
}
